#import "/_lib/0.1.1.typ": *
#show: template

#taxon[Definition]
#title[Dirichlet Product of functions]

We can model the formal product of two dirichlet series by defining a dirichlet product for functions from $NN_+$ into a ring, say $QQ$.

For $f,g : NN_+ -> QQ$, define
$
  (f *_D g)(n) :-= plus.big_(sum (k,l : NN), k * l = n) f(k) * g(l).
$

